#
# ============================================================================
# ANALYSIS — Phase 0 diagnosis (before-numbers), 2026-07-19
# ============================================================================
#
# Setup notes / gotchas hit during capture (see task-1-report.md for full
# writeup):
#   - BusyBox `nohup` is not present on this router; used `setsid ... &` instead.
#   - CRITICAL: `/usr/sbin/nym-vpn-watchdog` (a separate procd "always-on"
#     service, watchdog_interval=30s) polls `/etc/init.d/nym-vpnd status` and
#     calls `/etc/init.d/nym-vpnd start` whenever it doesn't see a procd-owned
#     instance running. Since the manually-launched instrumented daemon is NOT
#     a procd instance, the watchdog kept starting a competing plain (no
#     RUST_LOG) nym-vpnd, which unlinks + rebinds /var/run/nym-vpn.sock,
#     silently stealing all subsequent nym-vpnc traffic away from the
#     instrumented process. First two capture attempts produced empty/no-op
#     logs (0 probe/handshake/tunnel-state lines) because of this — NOT an
#     env-quoting failure (verified RUST_LOG was correctly present in
#     /proc/<pid>/environ throughout). Fix: `/etc/init.d/nym-vpn-watchdog stop`
#     before starting the instrumented daemon; restarted it during restore.
#   - RUST_LOG="info,nym_connection_monitor=trace,gotatun=debug" confirmed
#     correct and sufficient once the watchdog was out of the way.
#
# Log contains one untimed smoke-test cycle (~17:25:24, used to validate the
# instrumented daemon before the timed run) followed by the three brief-spec
# `time nym-vpnc connect -w` cycles. No connect failures / no retries needed
# across all 4 cycles.
#
# --- SMOKE-TEST CYCLE (untimed validation run, not one of the 3 official) ---
#   Connecting start (resolving api addrs): 17:25:24.067941
#   Tunnel-up (2nd "connecting tunnel" transition, entry+exit named):
#                                            17:25:26.734772
#   Handshake initiations sent (entry+exit, back-to-back):
#                                            17:25:26.652162 / 17:25:26.652394
#   1st handshake_response received (one hop only): 17:25:26.800612
#   Initial probe sent (3000ms timeout):    17:25:26.734920
#   Retry probe sent (cadence, +3000ms):    17:25:29.737038
#   HANDSHAKE(REKEY_TIMEOUT) fired:         17:25:31.673744  (+5.021s after
#                                            first handshake_initiation)
#   2nd handshake_initiation (post-rekey):  17:25:31.673987
#   2nd handshake_response received:        17:25:31.857317  (184ms RTT)
#   Probe succeeded (186ms after 2nd handshake_response):
#                                            17:25:32.043166  (2306ms after the
#                                            retry probe was sent)
#   New tunnel state: Connected:            17:25:35.377897  (+3.335s after
