#   Total connect (log-derived):            12.034s  (shell measured 12.34s;
#                                            ~0.3s overhead)
#   Tunnel-up -> viable:                    9.547s
#   VERDICT: REKEY_TIMEOUT-bound, with one extra idle cadence tick layered on
#     top (the retry-probe-#1-at-47.4s attempt still fell before the rekey
#     landed, so it also failed; success needed BOTH the rekey AND the next
#     cadence slot at 50.4s). This is the slowest of the 3 cycles.
