#   Connecting start:                       17:26:57.996778
#   Tunnel-up (2nd connecting-tunnel line):  17:26:59.912355
#   Handshake initiations sent:             17:26:59.817148 / 17:26:59.817377
#   1st handshake_response:                 17:26:59.967329
#   Initial probe sent (3000ms):            17:26:59.912522
